    "decisions": {
      "D-210": "Ekstrakurikuler with Pramuka or another kepanduan is offered (Permendikdasmen 13/2025 Pasal 22).",
      "D-216": "Ekstrakurikuler records (activities, pembina, members, attendance, rapor description) are built early in v1, with Pramuka offered by default.",
